# shallow.part -- The block of test/textured.part with too little draft
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The sides lean 1 degree, less than the 3 that the texture needs.
materials materials
profile p along z 0 0 0 40 0 0 40 20 0 0 20 0
extrude blk from 0 to 10 p draft 1
finish vdi30 blk.side
